The nowdoc in cookie-config.phtml is not shielded by Magento's HTML minifier, which collapses the
template into one line and drops the newline PHP requires after the opener - << is then parsed as a
shift operator and every storefront page dies with a ParseError. A plain heredoc is shielded; the
rendered JavaScript stays byte-identical.

